.Dd October 30, 2026
.Dt EXFAT.UTIL 8
.Os Minkar
.Sh NAME
.Nm exfat.util
.Nd probe exFAT volumes for diskarbitrationd
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Fl p
.Ar disk
.Cm removable Ns | Ns Cm fixed
.Cm readonly Ns | Ns Cm writable
.Nm
.Fl k
.Ar disk
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
lives in the exfat.fs bundle in
.Pa /System/Library/Filesystems .
.Xr diskarbitrationd 8
runs it on a disk whose partition type may hold exFAT.
.Ar disk
is a device name, such as
.Ql disk2s1 ,
read through its raw device.
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It Fl p
Prints the volume's label, if it has one, and exits with
.Dv FSUR_RECOGNIZED
(255) if the disk holds exFAT, or
.Dv FSUR_UNRECOGNIZED
(254) if not.
.It Fl k
Prints the volume's UUID, the same each time: a name-based UUID (version
3) made from the volume's serial number and its size and layout. Exits with
.Dv FSUR_IO_SUCCESS
(253).
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr diskarbitrationd 8 ,
.Xr diskutil 8 ,
.Xr fsck_exfat 8 ,
.Xr mount_exfat 8 ,
.Xr newfs_exfat 8
